{
  "sample": "internet-go-simplebank",
  "$comment": "Hand-labeled from the pinned sample source (scripts/samples.json, doc/** excluded: the generated statik bundle), not from Concentrate output. A gin API (api/), a gRPC server with a grpc-gateway HTTP mux (gapi/, main.go), sqlc queries on pgx (db/sqlc/) and an asynq worker; the Vue frontend/ is not labeled. Routes: the seven routes api/server.go registers (four on router.Group(\"/\").Use(authMiddleware(...)), which gin returns with the middleware) and the two net/http mounts runGatewayServer makes; the grpc-gateway patterns in the generated pb/*.pb.gw.go are not routes Concentrate is labeled for. Calls: every call site in the files listed whose callee is a function or method of this repository (generated pb getters and registration functions included), with the functions it runs; calls into gin, pgx, asynq, zerolog, grpc, gomock and the standard library, and calls of function values (fn, arg.AfterCreate, stop) are not labeled. A call on an interface is labeled with every type in the repository whose method set has the method with the same signature: db.Store with the sqlc Queries method SQLStore promotes (or SQLStore's own transaction method) and the gomock MockStore; worker.TaskDistributor with RedisTaskDistributor and the mock; token.Maker with JWTMaker and PasetoMaker; worker.TaskProcessor and mail.EmailSender have one implementer. q in the closures execTx is passed is a *Queries. Data access: each sqlc query method in db/sqlc/*.sql.go, by the table its SQL names (sqlc models are tables). Env: viper.Unmarshal in util.LoadConfig fills Config, whose mapstructure keys viper's AutomaticEnv reads from the environment.",
